      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A massive three-armed giantess with grey, warty skin, tusk-like fangs propping her mouth open, drool glistening down her chin. She wears a filthy gardener's apron over rags and a crown of dead roses. Her third arm holds huge garden shears.</p>",
